Music: none. The PA chime plays the Westminster Quarters (public domain melody, 1793), synthesised in code.
Sound: every sound is synthesised procedurally (numpy/scipy); no samples or recordings.
Picture: everything drawn in code (three.js r170, MIT); no images, footage or generated video.
Engine techniques adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar library's Liminal Found Footage demo (MIT): VHS shader, OSD font, lighting model, shoe rig.
